Dear Phil:

Thank you so much for taking the time to get back to us. We have been working with our Rstudio server IT support, but they are currently not considering an upgrade to Redhat 8, which will allow access to GSL 2.5, until much later in the Summer. I wonder if there is any possibility for your group to provide a version of the latest mirtCAT linked to gsl v1? I know this is a great deal of inconvenience for you, and I understand that in the long run, of course it makes more sense to upgrade to the newer version of GSL. But let us know if this is even a possibility. Thanks so much in advance!

Sy-Miin Chow

